# Tidecaller Mentor: "Threshold — When this creature enters, if there are seven or more cards in your graveyard, return up to one target
# nonland permanent to its owner's hand." (CR 207.2c, 603.4, 115.1, 400.7). Bot1's graveyard reaches seven on turn 1: Faithless Looting and
# the two Islands it discards (3), Black Lotus sacrificed for {U} (4), and Thought Scour on Bot1 milling two Islands and then itself (7).
# On turn 3 the Mentor ({1}{U}{B}) enters; the only legal targets are nonland permanents, so Bot2's Island is refused and its Memnite is
# returned to Bot2's hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Faithless Looting
Thought Scour
Tidecaller Mentor
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
